    "detailed_description": "Civil War: 1862 is the prequel to the highly acclaimed Civil War: 1863! Relive iconic battles of the American Civil War. Take command of both the Union and Confederate forces in this exciting turn-based strategy game.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  8 Mission \u2018Tutorial\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  5 Mission \u2018Fix Bayonets\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Steel and Thunder\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Colossus\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Fresh Troops\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Death and Glory\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Broken Line\u2019 campaign.<br></li><li>  8 Mission \u2018Shot and Shell\u2019 campaign comprising a series on non-historical game challenges.<br></li><li>  All missions can be played as both sides\u2028 (except the tutorial).<br></li><li>  8 Unique Civil War Units:<br>- Infantry with Muskets.<br>- Infantry with Rifled Muskets.<br>- Artillery.<br>- Generals.<br>- Wagons.<br>- Naval Gunboats.<br>- Dismounted and Mounted Cavalry.<br></li><li> Four classes of infantry \u2013 Raw, Average, Veteran and Elite.<br></li><li> Different infantry formations: unformed, line for shooting and column for charging!<br></li><li>  Detailed Combat Analysis.<br></li><li>  Flank Attacks\u2028.<br></li><li>  Strategic Movement.<br></li><li>  Hours of Gameplay</li></ul>",
